00:29.944 --> 00:32.834
If you were to take cross
sections of the figure,

00:32.834 --> 00:34.659
that's what this yellow line is.

00:34.659 --> 00:37.125
If you were to take cross
sections of this figure,

00:37.125 --> 00:39.853
that our vertical, I should say

00:39.853 --> 00:42.625
our perpendicular to the X axis,

00:42.625 --> 00:44.899
those cross sections are going to be

00:44.899 --> 00:47.518
